      "text": "Hey Allies, I'm excited for another What You Know Wednesday. Today we're going to talk a little bit about Starlink. Most of our Alliance units are equipped with an input. In the pass-through storage bay, and also another one on the inside. Well, Starlink has two systems now: they have the Starlink, and then they have a Starlink Mini. If you have the standard Starlink, you are going to need to use these plug-ins. If you get the newer mini, That is old Bluetooth enabled, so you're not going to need those same connection ports. So now you know."
